      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The authors assessed efficacy and safety of class 2 compression knitwear VENOTEKS TREND used in conservative and injection phlebosclerosing therapy of patients presenting with clinical class C1-C3 chronic venous diseases of the lower limbs. The study included a total of 30 patients. The compliance rate amounted to 92%. It was demonstrated that class 2 compression knitwear Venoteks Trend statistically significantly decreases the degree of subjective symptomatology, is efficient and safe in therapy for oedematous syndrome in the programmes of conservative treatment and after sclerotherapy."},
